hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"930","(89) Zabihon mein jo aya hai us ka bab: Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan Sauri ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, Abaya ibn Rifaa se, Rafi' ibn Khadij Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath Tihama wale Zu al-Hulayfa mein the, to logon ko bakriyan aur oont mile, to unhon ne un mein jaldi ki pas un se handiyan ubalin, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) un ke paas pahunche, to Aap ne handiyon ka hukm diya to woh undhel di gayin, aur Aap ne das bakriyon ko ek oont ke barabar qarar diya, unhon ne kaha: Aur un mein se ek oont bhag nikla to ek shakhs ne use teer mara to use rok diya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak in chaupayon mein wahshi janwaron ki tarah wahshi hone wale hote hain, pas jo tum par ghalib aa jaye to us ke sath isi tarah karo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Rafi' ibn Khadij Aap ke paas aye to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah! Hum darte hain - ya unhon ne kaha: hum ummeed rakhte hain - ke hum kal dushman se milenge aur hamare paas chhuriyan nahin hain, to kya hum sarkande (qasab) se zibah kar len? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khoon baha de aur us par Allah ka naam zikr kiya gaya ho to khao, siwaye daant aur nakhun ke, aur main tumhen (us ki wajah) bayan karunga: raha daant to woh haddi hai, aur raha nakhun to woh Habsha ki chhuri hai, phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak Madina mein ek pani dhone wala oont (nadih) kunwen mein gir gaya to use us ke pahlu (shakila) ki taraf se zakat (zibah) kiya gaya yani us ki kokh (khasira) ki taraf se, to Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ne us mein se daswan hissa do dirhamon ke badle liya."
"931","Ahmad ibn Sa'id Darimi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hibban - yani Ibn Hilal - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir - yani Ibn Hazim - ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub mujhe Zayd ibn Aslam se hadees bayan karte the, phir main Zayd se mila to main ne un se pucha, to unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Ata ibn Yasar ne bayan kiya, Abu Sa'id Khudri Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Ansar mein se ek shakhs ki ek oontni thi jo Uhud ki taraf char rahi thi, to woh sar­kash ho gayi pas us ne use ek mekh (watad) se nahr kar diya. Main ne Zayd se kaha: Lohe se ya lakdi se? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, balke lakdi se. Unhon ne kaha: Phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aye to unhon ne Aap se us ke bare mein pucha to Aap ne unhen use khane ka hukm diya."
"932","Ibrahim ibn Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yazid ibn Harun ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne mujhe khabar di, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke ek aurat Ka'b ibn Malik ki bakriyan Sal' mein charaya karti thi, to use ek bakri ke marne ka khauf hua, to us ne ek pathar liya aur use us se zibah kar diya, aur yeh baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se zikr ki gayi to Aap ne unhen use khane ka hukm diya."
"933","Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - yani Ibn Sa'id - ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'ba se, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas Raziallahu anhu ko kehte hue suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke janwaron ko baandh kar nishana banaya jaye."
"934","Abu Sa'id Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, Hafs ibn Ghiyath se, unhon ne kaha: Khalid Hazza ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Qilaba se, Abu Ash'ath San'ani se, Shaddad ibn Aws Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne har cheez par ehsan likh diya hai, pas qatl ko umda tarike se karo, aur zibah ko umda tarike se karo, aur tum mein se har ek ko chahiye ke apni chhuri (shafra) tez kare aur apne zabiha ko aaram pahunchaye."
"935","Abu Sa'id Ashajj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Khalid Ahmar ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujalid se, Abu Waddak se, Abu Sa'id Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se janin (pet ke bachche) ke bare mein pucha, to Aap ne farmaya: Agar chaho to use khao, pas beshak us ki zakat us ki maan ki zakat hai."
"936","Ishaq ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman - yani Ibn Mahdi - ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ibn Salama ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ushara se, un ke walid se: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulallah! Kya zakat (zibah) halq aur labba ke siwa nahin hoti? To Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum ne us ki raan mein neza mara hota to tumhari taraf se kifayat kar jata. Ibn Mahdi ne kaha: Yeh us ke bare mein hai jis par qabu na paya ja sake, jo (oonchayi se) girne wale (janwar) ke mushabeh hai."
